      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 527553499}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Years ago, the spikes were upset that this game wasn't difficult enough...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: They craved to see the blood of the player... so they created these
        lost levels designed to kill, which is where you are now
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: We haven't seen the spikes this upset in years, they haven't bought
        anyone to these levels for so long....
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: But now you're here, and we can't stop it...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: THIS WAS SUPPOSED TO BE A FUN GAME, WHY???
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Be careful, this level looks suspiciously easy, but Mr. Spike is out
        to kill
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6791474836595990750, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: Proceed with caution!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 81240dc76d61c0c489fe01d0052af6f1, type: 3}
